{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c082070bbddf8809b54d9d6c5396de9576761f5e23d36db005665c6fdd5fffed", "ja": "愛と友情の閃光☆HANABI団", "zh": "爱与友情的『闪光☆HANABI团』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d31f731549021b39c9cbd8cf12838c850bff05c48bb49cee2cd4f03bd6499145", "ja": "倒れてしまったのり子、泣いて走り去った\n海美。もはや閃光☆HANABI団は瓦解寸前かと\n思われたが、メンバーの絆は決して壊れず、\n友情は更に深まった。作業の後は、全員で\n花火を見て楽しむ。", "zh": "法子倒下，海美哭着跑走。\n『闪光☆HANABI团』看似即将瓦解，\n然而团员间的羁绊坚不可摧，反倒更加深了友情。\n作业结束后，所有人一起开心观赏烟火。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "25546069cdff9b9a8221c27c640dbcb052e769cad237bb5f42c88bd83fb2e7e7", "ja": "（海美の作った女子力やきそばを試食した\nのり子が、倒れてしまった……）", "zh": "（试吃完海美做的女子力炒面后，\n法子就倒下了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3efc213cfb2f073568cad26ec7ef197651cb8933c1de15c9f5c3444e0f6b9ebf", "ja": "（海美は、泣いて走って行ってしまった。そっちも心配\nだが……奈緒が追いかけているし、まずはのり子だ）", "zh": "（海美则是哭着跑走了。虽然我也很担心她……\n不过奈绪已经追上去了，我就先照顾法子吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "396b61c7aa835410ba9b50251adc82e06e30b88e63fa2f43e792965c701ebf6e", "ja": "……はっ！？", "zh": "……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "07011ae3b71fcd976fccaddce8456498d32c1f6fddcce5fa8cbd9c278cb0476d", "ja": "のり子！　目を覚ましたんだな！　無事か！？", "zh": "法子！你醒了啊！没事吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "740d8c7b58f2c42330b0160ab4929464f7bcbc2ac49e6b1c6e9bcc80c6e901c7", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。\nなんかアタシ、すごい夢見てたんだよ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n我好像做了很迷幻的梦喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "9a82eac62d5d5f83db39239bad55c9b000a633d1b613d780263605feabcc0ff9", "ja": "ピンク色のユニコーンが、チョコレートの川の上で\n空中プロレスを繰り広げてて……聞いてる？", "zh": "我梦见粉红色的独角兽，\n在巧克力河上进行空中摔角……你有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "01525dd40197d896298c8626f087cc43c590f80d14c765c354ee8de917258286", "ja": "の、のり子……やっぱり……。", "zh": "法、法子……你果然……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "704ec8c03b4aa37c0c0f842637a285bef0b02354977477daaa9362cd1810b015", "ja": "のり子さん、大丈夫？\n気分が悪いとか、どこか痛いとかない？", "zh": "法子，你还好吗？\n你有没有觉得不舒服，或是哪里会痛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "3bc662207ad392c2300e7d92b60b6049dea3cd1fe74e43f1821e30b083ed7a7d", "ja": "え？　普通に元気だよ？\n……あれ？　アタシ、何かヘンなコト言った……？", "zh": "嗯？我跟平常一样有精神啊？\n……咦？我说了什么奇怪的话吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "45f9ead31a3cd9a4bd802b176b1623a0b6031a6ae457c56c1ea728c49fb0bdd4", "ja": "よかった……。{$P$}さん、\n意識ははっきりしてるみたいです！", "zh": "太好了……{$P$}先生，\n她的意识好像还很清醒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a48bdce2cec499f39f576e586fa0cb2f7467c3459aa15478ed41e697324cc584", "ja": "意外とすぐ、やきそばの効果が切れたみたいだな。\n本当によかった……。", "zh": "看来炒面的效果比想像中更短暂呢。\n真是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "8404b741123bb4bc8097285e1094298eead79885c19c06227125a0ee6584e503", "ja": "てかアタシ、なんで寝てたんだっけ？　うーん……。\nあ、そういえば海美たちは？", "zh": "话说我为什么会睡着了？唔……\n啊，这么说来海美她们呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "dbf691d7fdefc97fa67d58d876518040dc6995b180b0cb63fa49eb7e4b0b7c3f", "ja": "そうだ、あのふたりを迎えにいかないと！\nちょっと行ってくる！", "zh": "对了，我得去接她们两个回来！\n我去去就回！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "715157f2de7c346b320733e81dab573c3d518db0fcdd95faddd6bfdb64f41c24", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "e457666ed7649994d9725f3156cceea789a40ad9e1932104f7f79eb8497d764e", "ja": "うう、ひっく……ぐす。そうやったんやな。\nわかる、わかるで、海美。ぐすっ……。", "zh": "呜呜，呜噎……呜。原来是这样啊。\n我懂、我懂啊，海美。呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "897b52535d1e7f3cbc2bc40c211d60c4ca015332a8f938fd252aad502dc684c6", "ja": "ぐす、ぐす……。\nありがとう、わかってくれて。なおー！", "zh": "呜，呜……\n谢谢你懂我，奈绪～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "77aac7ce2664ef3a777338cc956275ae5db8f355cc0b5d2a8290894ebb892ce6", "ja": "（ん……？　なぜか友情が深まっているようだ。\nなんというか、女子は奥深いな……）", "zh": "（嗯……？不知为何她们的友情好像更深厚了。\n该怎么说呢，女生真是复杂啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7fcac8c7c5f62fd7c018e5882f62dee568cd2aa5939b8dafbe24e14a45c6e988", "ja": "海美、奈緒！　心配したぞ。何があったか、\n追求はしないけど……もう大丈夫みたいだな？", "zh": "海美、奈绪！我好担心你们两个。\n我不会多问发生了什么事……但似乎没事了对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "754dbe61c6abd8e64dff59bd24a6cf6cd0f3a8f6767257d18269a32435cb0e50", "ja": "うん！　心配かけてごめんね{$P$}。\nもう元気だから……なおー、ありがとね！", "zh": "嗯！抱歉让你担心了，{$P$}。\n我已经打起精神了……奈绪～谢谢你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "ee0e583ff9ed2b8ddc79f9b26b62aaac9d680a1808be9f118a7cdef92b8ee848", "ja": "{$P$}さん、海美のこと\n責めんといてな。悪気はなかってん。……うぅっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，请别太责备海美啊，\n她没有恶意的……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "ca519ad20398d6b95966840ff8684d244fdbcd5631ee77278de00d39218a05c6", "ja": "海美～っ！　私、海美のこと大好きやで！\nうぇええんっ！", "zh": "海美～！我最喜欢海美了啊！\n呜呜呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "0851396707f18914ac6c183112e120658715f9232fe452dda800a360d813d300", "ja": "私も、なおーのこと、超大好きっ！\nごめんね、ごめんね。うぇ～んっ……！！", "zh": "我也超级喜欢奈绪～！\n对不起、对不起，呜呜……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ef0c715aa052d5b72ed1ba84bd005001d0b6b7952d06479005b567a053ed6ee2", "ja": "う、うーん……？\nま、まあとりあえずよかった！　ははは。", "zh": "唔、唔～嗯……？\n总、总而言之真是太好了！哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "49d11bde32d3f37a6bf7ed4041c45171df1f8fd05ebf7928ec8910f3ea7daa0a", "ja": "あっ！　それより{$P$}、\nのりさんは？　のりさんは無事なの！？", "zh": "啊！话说回来，{$P$}，\n阿法姊呢？阿法姊她没事吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "703f7eb33a486f550be57d7180eaf2701fa7681d0d267e36fa490260dbb8b7c4", "ja": "ああ、のり子は大丈夫だよ。\n安心してくれ。", "zh": "嗯，法子她没事喔。\n你们放心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "db44f37e6efc6d61044ac6465f503b95087d0c8a1ff1132d2a4753220d5e9595", "ja": "そっか、よかった～……。でも、ちゃんと\n謝らなくちゃ。ねえ、みんなはどこ？", "zh": "是吗，太好了……不过，我得好好向她道歉才行。\n问你喔，大家现在人在哪里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "a0af0fc9ed2c66f7268848fd7a3e1689b7e8d96f65bba266b96b3d3e0c82e928", "ja": "ここにいたんですね、{$P$}。\n海美と奈緒ちゃんは……もう大丈夫？", "zh": "原来你们在这里啊，{$P$}。\n海美和小绪……你们已经没事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "df547e5f7274a670bf5b58267d695bba7592bd9661c320db271237b2fce1a877", "ja": "うん！　ごめんな紗代子、美奈子も。\n心配かけてもうて……。", "zh": "嗯！对不起纱代子，还有美奈子也是。\n让你们担心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "3008905af6ad718e0657a971011ac491980ad569a9b1e851bb8ecbb665af3a1b", "ja": "ううん。のり子ちゃんも無事だし、\nふたりが仲直りできたなら、それで十分だよ！", "zh": "不会啦，反正小法也没事，\n只要你们两个和好那就够了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "7d9eb93cc33de313a8b24d7fb02a8864369651bc35e2f20779d3d9d9a56d3fe0", "ja": "あ、その……ごめんっ！　のりさん！", "zh": "呃，那个……对不起！阿法姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "5a1859f7957b1e0a14cae07dbdf3af3118bb4f2559c9c0bcd490774d034fb199", "ja": "ん？　どうしたの、海美。", "zh": "嗯？怎么突然道歉呢，海美？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1031_029umi", "source_sha256": "d020133d8c35eee08842422ce1075b0c77577b8ad0a261a168c374781d7f722f", "ja": "だって、私の女子力やきそばのせいで\nあんな事になっちゃったんだし……。", "zh": "毕竟都怪我的女子力炒面，\n才导致那种事发生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "b01cd17d914b762d4b656cca6238d47fdc91004ba18ba9bc16fbd6d7ad5b27a7", "ja": "あー、そんなの気にしなくて大丈夫だよ！　そりゃ、\nちょっとビックリしたけど……でも考えたんだよ。", "zh": "哦～你不必在意这个啦！\n虽然我确实吓一跳……但我也想过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1033_043nor", "source_sha256": "04c72a360feee615d7c66efd9c22fd0f3fa96df83171c93855c2c09f65341f5a", "ja": "焼きそばを食べてプロレス技をくらった気分になれる\nなんて、もしかしたらお得なんじゃない？って！", "zh": "「吃口炒面就能尝到中了摔角技的滋味，好像有点赚？」\n我是这样觉得啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "af301cfddc26e54f3c63e7b2255db082635b7bd233ed2b0c15db3aaf43642607", "ja": "さすがにそれは、前向きすぎるような……\n何にせよ、無事でよかったよ。", "zh": "这样想未免太乐观了吧……\n无论如何，你没事真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1035_043nor", "source_sha256": "a2038acd4eef62aff1640562586c4c3e412b5114a40c6b8b27d3f2f461c8cd76", "ja": "あっ、ホラ！　こうやって{$P$}も\n心配してくれるしね。へへっ♪　だから大丈夫！", "zh": "啊，你看！还有{$P$}这么担心我。\n嘿嘿♪所以没关系啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "258025aa2ba6b5b63689da0613ad8c35c3165c7ce93115f84c00a3c9abe704aa", "ja": "のりさん……ううっ、ありがと～っ！", "zh": "阿法姊……呜呜，谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1037_043nor", "source_sha256": "96f11007ca19d2210423b2f182ebb438b281e09881f7e33d3b089e43d6b4e80f", "ja": "あははっ！　泣かないでよ、海美～……って、あれ？\nま、待って！　みんな、あそこにユニコーンが！", "zh": "哈哈！别哭啦，海美……咦，奇怪？\n等、等一下！大家快看，那边有独角兽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "f42d42df264dea8017f449af7f7758233a01343c4731c8ebeeecd5a67ca2d4be", "ja": "のり子……ほんまに大丈夫なんか……？", "zh": "法子……你真的没事吼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1039_027say", "source_sha256": "887ac38a70dac82aa782a272c9bbd85901adda91e5b4ff5a0534168023d74268", "ja": "女子力やきそばは、スパイスの量が問題だったみたい。\nきちんと量を調節して、私達の屋台で出そう！", "zh": "女子力炒面的问题，好像是出在香辛料的份量上。\n来把份量调整好，在我们的摊贩上贩售吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1040_019min", "source_sha256": "5053f17e03c031053183d7463b4bf1ee8a96a2e5a4b6fb2b9d70a664f34e6900", "ja": "海美ちゃんが調理する時は\n私がしっかりフォローするから、安心してね！", "zh": "海美在料理时，\n我会好好从旁协助，尽管放心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "799ed5ae135c47a5217c33f66373d37174c14b13be8bbae1d68f40c3dea56afd", "ja": "うんっ！　ふたりとも、ありがとうっ！", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你们两位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "0c3d5f95b2f272ba48b8a03705696882ab3e3daa1e78dd0ef67e4025eb13aa4c", "ja": "みんな、今日の作業は終わったし、遊びに行かない？\n{$P$}、いいですよね！", "zh": "各位，今天的工作也做完了，要不要去玩啊？\n{$P$}，可以吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "7392c17d5bb3f2f1969a2481b9609111c3bd8dfd570f3c4e43075afbafda0456", "ja": "それは構わないけど……\n今から何をするんだ？", "zh": "可以是可以……\n但是这么晚了你们要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1044_null", "source_sha256": "8c40cadb9a0f2626401ccfffe333a4dd4c36129766437c9023adeee8e94aeb22", "ja": "ドドーン！", "zh": "咻──砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "c9a36b93e92a2b573675795b79802df4f63ebf01e675081f4baab9d7b3db4e38", "ja": "わぁっ……♪　花火花火、花火ーーーっ！", "zh": "哇……♪烟火烟火，烟火───！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "d0ae1876cc47d8d1e46064ceb2b6d0b9ac5da0e727a3f21852398ee27c42c5ee", "ja": "おお～。めっちゃええ眺めやな♪", "zh": "哦哦～视野真好嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1047_027say", "source_sha256": "cee2d60144d45409169727b5ae4c908ed30494f2350d4a4a71e0ee146a75cefa", "ja": "実は、今日向こう岸で花火大会があるって、\nステージの設営中に教えてもらったんです！", "zh": "其实我们在搭建舞台时听到人家说，\n今天对面河岸有烟火大会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "bf55082a0d47f9611b44e477cdd194ef9a148112378929cfaf5b4dde95a217b8", "ja": "この場所からでも綺麗に見えるって聞いたので、\n夜になったら、みんなで見ようって話してたんですよ♪", "zh": "听说烟火从这边看过去也很美，\n大家就说好等天黑以后要一起来看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "a92848bd5342c1d9b560b93139104b9e12ba9feb127894c99d744b547ff941ad", "ja": "（色々あったけど、なんとか落ち着いたし……\n結果的に、ユニットの結束力も高まったみたいだ）", "zh": "（虽然发生很多事，但总算平安告一段落……\n就结果而言，团体好像也变得更团结了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "0487ea7c125ed30b17b247335decd3e2789786a7894e125e3d950f19b36c5d80", "ja": "（キャンプに設営に……この夏が、\n閃光☆HANABI団のいい思い出になるといいな）", "zh": "（露营加上搭建舞台……希望今年夏天，\n能成为『闪光☆HANABI团』的美好回忆。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1051_043nor", "source_sha256": "e0a379ba2d4cb5c6370f1d7456b73e67bd235017d941a7394758ab4231a9c2c8", "ja": "{$P$}。\n花火、すっごくきれいだね！", "zh": "{$P$}，\n烟火很美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "04727c9d392753072b1f50286e12b05eeb96001d16505f0f194040be58527699", "ja": "ああ、そうだな。", "zh": "嗯，就是说啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1053_043nor", "source_sha256": "58ab75cd3bc173368beb71cf195ed6b75a2805f3fda50c45c41986f7d707200d", "ja": "ほら、特にあのピンク色の花火！　\nユニコーンみたい……♪", "zh": "你看，特别是那个粉红色的烟火！\n好像独角兽一样……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0035_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0035_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "fc3d9f08aca3924902193f73d49bad777b6d7dfd57ca62bf697f915d092b7dca", "ja": "（いい思い出になるよう、もう少しのり子を見守ろう）", "zh": "（为了确保这会成为美好的回忆，\n我再多注意一下法子吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
